Delete the note "{{fileId}}" from the knowledge graph.

Steps:
1. Call get_md_file with file_id="{{fileId}}" to confirm it exists.
   If the file is not found, stop and inform the user.
2. Call get_related_md_files with file_id="{{fileId}}" to identify notes that link to it.
   Warn the user about any dangling wiki-links that will result from the deletion.
3. Ask for explicit confirmation before proceeding.
4. Call delete_md_file with file_id="{{fileId}}".
5. Report the deletion result and list any notes that now have dangling links.
